WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.700
Compliance, built for the speed of AI.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.350
Teams ship faster than ever, but proving their data is handled correctly hasn't kept up.

3
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:24.250
Herculean handles load and compliance in the same layer. Its purpose-trained model, Iolaus, watches your database continuously: what personal data you hold, where it goes, and who can reach it.

4
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:33.250
Every check leaves evidence, so compliance stops being a yearly scramble and becomes a working record you can show.

5
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.800
One platform for SOC 2 readiness.

6
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.850
Herculean. Designed for your greatest tasks.
